# Three local folders, never committed. Each manages a different unique circumstance;
# see the README's "Local folders" section for which is which.
# Both spellings of memory are ignored so a folder created under either name cannot leak.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. Unanchored, git matches the name at ANY depth
# and silently swallowed templates/layout/, whose whole purpose is to be committed and
# handed to an adopter. The failure was invisible until something checked.
/.memory/
/memory/
/.profile/
/.workgroup/

# Dealpath-specific discipline. Authored here, pushed to a separate Dealpath repository.
# Remove this entry in that repository -- it is what keeps the generic package generic.
/foundations/Dealpath/

# Agent scratchpad. Declared here rather than globally, for the same reason as above.
*.memory.md

# Recordings are raw material -- bulky, disposable, and full of workspace paths.
# What outlives one is what was distilled out of it, which lives in .memory/.
observations/
